### Health/example route without real credentials
GET http://localhost:8080/routes HTTP/1.1
x-tenant-id: <tenant-id>
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Host: localhost:8080

### OIDC client_credentials without real secrets
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/realms/<tenant-id>/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=<client-id>&client_secret=<client-secret>&scope=openid

### Example request with synthetic data only
POST http://localhost:8080/<tenant-id>/orders/events HTTP/1.1
x-tenant-id: <tenant-id>
Authorization: Bearer <access-token>
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "order_id": "example-order",
  "customer_ref": "example-customer",
  "amount": 100
}
